<title>USA: Men's Wearhouse Jan same-store sales rose.</title>
<headline>Men's Wearhouse Jan same-store sales rose.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		     1997	 1996	Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$51.3	$37.3    + 37.6     + 18.6</p>
<p>Quarter	   $170.7     $138.3    + 23.4	+ 6.2</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $483.5     $401.3    + 20.5	+ 3.9</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   four weeks ended  Feb. 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Sales for five calendar weeks ended February 3, 1996 were $49.4 million. Sales for 53-weeks ended February 3, 1996 totaled $406.3 million.</p>
</text>
